ure","text":"It's the Rathalos!"},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"avg_502_Yato_1#5$1","name2":"char_500_noirc_1","focus":2}},{"t":"line","name":"Noir Corne","text":"Another one!"},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"avg_502_Yato_1#7$1","name2":"char_500_noirc_1","focus":1}},{"t":"line","name":"Yato","text":"Careful! They could be aggressive!"},{"t":"line","name":"Yato","text":"Be ready for battle!"},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"avg_502_Yato_1#7$1","name2":"char_500_noirc_1","focus":2}},{"t":"line","name":"Noir Corne","text":"Hold on... look at their movements, Yato."},{"t":"cmd","c":"dialog","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"avg_npc_752_1#6$1"}},{"t":"cmd","c":"playsound","a":{"key":"Sound_Beta_2/CustomSE/act24side#retro/act24side_otomo000_vo_type01_pitch0_alt_talk_message_menu_alt01"}},{"t":"cmd","c":"characteraction","a":{"name":"middle","type":"jump","xpos":-15,"times":1,"power":5,"fadetime":0.5,"isblock":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"characteraction","a":{"name":"middle","type":"jump","xpos":15,"times":1,"power":5,"fadetime":0.5,"isblock":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"characteraction","a":{"name":"middle","type":"jump","xpos":-15,"times":1,"power":5,"fadetime":0.5,"isblock":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"characteraction","a":{"name":"middle","type":"jump","xpos":15,"times":1,"power":5,"fadetime":0.5,"isblock":true}},{"t":"line","name":"Strange White Creature","text":"(Dances)"},{"t":"line","name":"Strange White Creature","text":"Rathalos! Rathalos!"},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"avg_502_Yato_1#5$1","name2":"char_500_noirc_1","focus":2}},{"t":"line","name":"Noir Corne","text":"They're dancing... they don't look hostile."},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"avg_502_Yato_1#5$1","name2":"char_500_noirc_1","focus":1}},{"t":"line","name":"Yato","text":"Hey! Who are you? Are you Felines? Do you understand what I'm saying?"},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"avg_502_Yato_1#4$1","name2":"char_500_noirc_1","focus":1}},{"t":"line","name":"Yato","text":"They don't seem to be Felines... are they non-sapient?"},{"t":"line","name":"Yato","text":"What did they say again?"},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"avg_502_Yato_1#4$1","name2":"char_500_noirc_1","focus":2}},{"t":"line","name":"Noir Corne","text":"I'm not sure... something about the scratches? Or the creature that left them?"},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"avg_npc_752_1#3$1"}},{"t":"cmd","c":"playsound","a":{"key":"Sound_Beta_2/CustomSE/act24side#retro/act24side_otomo000_vo_type01_pitch0_attack_alt01"}},{"t":"cmd","c":"characteraction","a":{"name":"middle","type":"jump","times":2,"power":10,"fadetime":0.5,"block":false}},{"t":"line","name":"Strange White Creature","text":"Who are mew calling non-sapient, you rude, horned lass!"},{"t":"line","name":"Strange White Creature","text":"(Points towards the scratches on the ground)"},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"avg_npc_752_1#6$1"}},{"t":"line","name":"Strange White Creature","text":"It's coming!"},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"avg_502_Yato_1#5$1","name2":"char_500_noirc_1","focus":2}},{"t":"line","name":"Noir Corne","text":"It can talk! It can talk!"},{"t":"line","name":"Noir Corne","text":"I think he just called you rude, Yato."},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"avg_502_Yato_1#5$1","name2":"char_500_noirc_1","focus":1}},{"t":"line","name":"Yato","text":"It's coming? What's coming?"},{"t":"cmd","c":"dialog","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"avg_npc_751_1#4$1"}},{"t":"line","name":"Strange Yellow Creature","text":"Never seen gear like this..."},{"t":"cmd","c":"dialog","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"playsound","a":{"key":"Sound_Beta_2/CustomSE/act24side#retro/act24side_otomo000_vo_type01_pitch0_happy_alt01"}},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"avg_npc_751_1#9$1"}},{"t":"cmd","c":"delay","a":{"time":0.5}},{"t":"cmd","c":"characteraction","a":{"name":"middle","type":"jump","ypos":30,"time":1,"power":30,"fadetime":1,"i